 (out/'README.md').write_text('# Batch007 — '+version+'\n\n'+str(len(entries))+' runnable English fictional development episodes. Target:10, T1–T5 two each. This package is an immutable construction/preflight input, not independent acceptance.\n\n`python verify.py` verifies hashes and exact CPU replay. `python runtime/rebuild.py --output <new-directory>` rebuilds the same definitions. `python runtime/reproduce.py --output <new-directory>` writes replay evidence. Open `review/index.html` for answer-visible offline review. No GPU, paid API or real platform is used.\n\nAttachments are textual evidence cards. Formal split, empirical difficulty calibration and human review are not performed.\n')
